config SPI_FLASH_LITESPI
	bool "SPI NOR Flash via LiteSPI master (W25Q64)"
	depends on FPGA_HAL_LITEX
	help
	  Enable in-system read/write access to the SPI NOR flash
	  via the LiteSPI master CSR interface. Requires the LiteX
	  SoC to instantiate the SpiFlash master CSR block — either
	  the stock `spiflash_master` (RAM-copy boot targets) or the
	  BIOS-invisible `spiflash_ctrl` (XIP-boot targets, cyc1000).
